  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic and Other Partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Misean Cara, D&#xf3;chas, Frontline Defenders, and Comhl&#xe1;mh make up CSU&apos;s Strategic Partners while the Others, Vita, HelpAge International, and Children in Crossfire are in receipt of 18 month bridge funding as they recalibrate in advance of application to the CSF 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To continue to engage constructively with our strategic and other partners on areas of 
mutual interest with a view to delivering results in line with Ireland&#x2019;s Policy for 
International Development, A Better World</narrative>
  </description>
